            <div xml:id="d366">

                <pb facs="0733" n="707" xml:id="pg707"/>

                <head>366. Memorandum From the Director of the Defense Intelligence Agency
                        (Carroll) to the
                    Secretary of Defense (McNamara)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d366-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">S-18982/P-3</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1963-12-13"><hi rendition="#italic">December 13,
                        1963</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>(S) THE VIET CONG IMPROVED COMBAT
                        EFFECTIVENESS AND INSURGENCY POSTURE</item>
                </list>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>The attachment is an assessment of the Viet Cong’s military capabilities
                        in the Republic of Viet-Nam, with emphasis on factors most likely to affect
                        the Viet Cong insurgency effort.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>This information has been provided to the Chairman, Joint Chiefs of Staff,
                        and to interested elements of the Joint Staff.</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Joseph F.
                                Carroll</hi><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Lieutenant
                            General, USAF</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d366-a1.xml" xpointer="d366-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
